          .num_example
            %h6#example Example
            %p
              Since
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pr%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29Cat"} Pr(∞,1)Cat
              admits all small limits, we obtain new locally presentable
              = succeed "-categories" do
