          %h3#LimitsAndColimits Limits and colimits
          %p
            In the first definition of locally presentable
            = succeed "-category" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
